---
import { AFFILIATE_URL } from '../data/plans';
---

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <!-- Brand column -->
      <div class="footer-col footer-brand">
        <a href="/" class="footer-logo">
          <svg class="logo-icon" viewBox="0 0 36 36" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M4 18C10 10 20 6 32 8C26 16 20 28 8 28C6 24 4 20 4 18Z" fill="url(#footer-sky-grad)"/>
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="footer-sky-grad" x1="4" y1="8" x2="32" y2="28" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                <stop stop-color="#E88A66"/>
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#845B9D"/>
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
          </svg>
          <span>FlyingBird 飞鸟机场</span>
        </a>
        <p class="brand-desc">
          FlyingBird 专注于提供高品质的跨国网络加速与订阅服务，致力于为您带来轻盈、稳定的数字旅程体验。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Links column 1 -->
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4 class="footer-heading">快速导航</h4>
        <ul class="footer-links">
          <li><a href="/">首页</a></li>
          <li><a href="/plans/">套餐方案</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guide/">使用指南</a></li>
          <li><a href="/devices/">客户端帮助</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Links column 2 -->
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4 class="footer-heading">知识与支持</h4>
        <ul class="footer-links">
          <li><a href="/network/">网络知识</a></li>
          <li><a href="/stories/">文章目录</a></li>
          <li><a href="/faq/">常见问题 FAQ</a></li>
          <li><a href={AFFILIATE_URL} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener">开通服务</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Commercial Disclosure column -->
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4 class="footer-heading">服务声明</h4>
        <p class="disclosure-text">
          本站为 FlyingBird 飞鸟机场单品牌官网落地页。页面所列套餐价格与线路描述均引自官方公开数据。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer Bottom -->
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p class="copyright">
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} FlyingBird (iflyingbird.sbs). All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer {
    background-color: var(--color-deep-indigo);
    color: #A0AEC0;
    padding: 4rem 0 2rem 0;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .footer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .footer-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .logo-icon {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
  }

  .brand-desc {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #CBD5E0;
  }

  .footer-heading {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .footer-links {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    color: #CBD5E0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: var(--color-sunset-orange);
  }

  .disclosure-text {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #A0AEC0;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #718096;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
